# Descriptor: [B- -> X(Lambda_c pbar) l- nu] dummy-resonant gap mode, e and mu, cc
# NickName: Bu_LcPlnu_dummyres_gapmodes
# Documentation: B -> Lambda_c pbar l nu via wide dummy resonance (m=3.8 GeV, w=3.0 GeV).
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260429

Alias LcP0sig D_0*0
Alias anti-LcP0sig anti-D_0*0
ChargeConj LcP0sig anti-LcP0sig

Particle LcP0sig      3.8 3.0
Particle anti-LcP0sig 3.8 3.0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 LcP0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 LcP0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

Decay LcP0sig
1.0 anti-Lambda_c- p+ PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-LcP0sig

Decay Lambda_c+
1.00  p+  K-  pi+  PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-Lambda_c-

End
